Momentary self-buff granting Enhanced Parry (Sword) +2 [10] against one incoming attack.  Because the same defensive Jutsu may be activated repeatedly when its cadence permits, a practitioner can keep choosing Drop Ripple Thrust against successive attacks during the same action cycle, but doing so prevents selection of a different offensive Jutsu until the next action.
